@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
# STB setelah dipublikasikan: https://stb.stei.fun/api/v1

### Informasi API
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Buat akun development
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Pengguna Uji","email":"nourish-test@example.test","password":"NourishUji123"}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"nourish-test@example.test","password":"NourishUji123"}

### Lookup barcode dari Open Food Facts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/barcode/3017620422003
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cari produk yang cocok
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?q=Nutella&discover=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buat produk pribadi
# @name manual
POST {{baseUrl}}/manual-products
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Oat uji","basis":"MASS","nutrientsPer100":{"energy":375,"sugar":4,"sodium":0}}

### Setel preferensi gula
PUT {{baseUrl}}/preferences/sugar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value":10}

### Nilai produk pada porsi 50 gram
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessment/product
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":"{{manual.response.body.$.id}}","portion":{"quantity":50,"unit":"g"}}

### Tarik jadwal dan konsumsi
GET {{baseUrl}}/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Ringkasan gizi, sesuaikan tanggal
GET {{baseUrl}}/consumption/daily-summary?date=2026-11-21&timezone=Asia%2FJakarta
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
